The '''Furnace''' is one of the eleven workbench types in ''[[Human Host]]''.

Smelts ore into ingots. Requires fuel (Wood or Coal).

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.Furnace</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Furnace</code>.

